<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Transatlantic cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Transatlantic cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs lowered its rating on Transatlantic Holdings Inc to moderate outperform from recommended, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell one to 69-1/2 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
